1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"phase-0","kind":"phase-index","route":"/roadmap/phase-0","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/phase-0","sourceHash":"9f590b17f758d7c70c4c3324558bd4c9260bb9e816792f3fb183444244b124a3","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:11:29.361Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Immersion Learning","zh":"沉浸式学习"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Over the course of many decades of second language education, it's become clear that the methods used in schools and most language classrooms are ineffective. But thanks to years of dedicated research, serious language learners around the world, and the rise of the internet, a better alternative has emerged:","zh":"经过数十年的第二语言教育，人们已经清楚地认识到，学校和大多数语言课堂所采用的方法并不有效。但经过多年的专门研究、世界各地认真学习语言的人们的实践，以及互联网的兴起，一种更好的替代方案出现了："}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Immersion learning.</strong>","zh":"<strong>沉浸式学习。</strong>"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The word \"immersion\" usually carries connotations of moving to a foreign country. This is not that. This kind of immersion learning can be done from anywhere with an internet connection, by anyone who is dedicated to reaching their language goals.","zh":"“沉浸”这个词通常让人联想到搬到国外。这不是我们所说的沉浸。只要有互联网连接，任何致力于实现语言目标的人，无论身在何处，都可以进行这种沉浸式学习。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This guide is an updated and holistic walkthrough of how to do immersion learning. You don't need to read it all in one sitting, but it's a good idea to get a general picture of the whole process so you know what you're working toward. I suggest reading Phase 0 (base information) then continuing with whatever is most useful for you personally.","zh":"本指南全面更新并系统介绍了如何进行沉浸式学习。你不必一次读完，但最好先大致了解整个过程，这样就知道自己的努力方向。我建议先阅读第0阶段（基础信息），然后继续阅读对你个人最有用的内容。"}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The guide is divided into 7 phases. Each phase has a different primary focus, but it isn't the <em>only</em> thing you'll be working on. As you get more advanced, you'll be developing many skills in parallel.","zh":"本指南分为7个阶段。每个阶段都有不同的主要重点，但这并不是你要学习的<em>唯一</em>内容。随着水平提高，你会并行培养多项技能。"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The phases are meant to be done in order, but every learner has slightly different needs, interests, and goals. A certain amount of customization is expected — and encouraged. Do not feel obligated to do something just because the guide says so. But we do recommend giving everything a try before discarding it.","zh":"这些阶段通常应按顺序进行，但每位学习者的需求、兴趣和目标都略有不同。适当调整是预期之内的，也值得鼓励。不要因为指南这样写了，就觉得自己必须照做。不过，我们建议你在放弃某项内容之前，先全部尝试一遍。"}},{"id":"segment-0007","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"It's worth noting that learning a language is a big undertaking. No matter what method you use, it's going to take many hundreds (or thousands) of hours to reach proficiency. The time it takes depends on a lot of different factors. But if you focus on learning consistently, putting one foot in front of the other, you <em>will</em> reach fluency. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/categories-of-language-difficulty\">Categories of Language Difficulty</a>","zh":"值得注意的是，学习一门语言是一项艰巨的任务。无论采用什么方法，要达到熟练程度都需要数百（甚至数千）小时。所需时间取决于许多不同因素。但只要专注于持续学习，一步一步向前，你<em>就会</em>达到流利程度。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/categories-of-language-difficulty\">语言难度分类</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The guide is written like a wiki: unfamiliar terms, jargon, and references to other pages are links. Anything underlined and in a different color can be clicked for more information. Some links go to other pages in the guide, while others go to our Library — a collection of reference articles for concepts that come up across multiple phases.","zh":"本指南采用维基百科式的写法：不熟悉的术语、行话以及其他页面的引用都会以链接形式呈现。任何带下划线且颜色不同的文字都可以点击，以获取更多信息。有些链接会指向指南中的其他页面，有些则会指向我们的资料库——其中收集了贯穿多个阶段都会涉及的概念相关文章。"}},{"id":"segment-0009","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The remaining articles in Phase 0 explain the core ideas behind immersion learning:","zh":"第0阶段的其余文章将解释沉浸式学习背后的核心理念："}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"0A — Method Overview","zh":"0A — 方法概览"},{"en":"0B — Acquisition vs Study","zh":"0B — 习得与学习"},{"en":"0C — Immerse in the Language","zh":"0C — 沉浸于目标语言"},{"en":"0D — Enjoy the Process","zh":"0D — 享受过程"},{"en":"0E — Where to Begin","zh":"0E — 从哪里开始"}]},{"id":"youtube-Jo4ds4mxuhU","type":"embed","src":"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Jo4ds4mxuhU","title":{"en":"YouTube video","zh":"YouTube 视频"}}],"cards":[{"href":"/roadmap/phase-0/0a-method-overview","title":{"en":"0AMethod Overview","zh":"0A方法概览"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-0/0b-acquisition-vs-study","title":{"en":"0BAcquisition vs Study","zh":"0B习得与学习"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-0/0c-immerse-in-the-language","title":{"en":"0CImmerse in the Language","zh":"0C沉浸于目标语言"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-0/0d-enjoy-the-process","title":{"en":"0DEnjoy the Process","zh":"0D享受过程"}},{"href":"/roadmap/phase-0/0e-where-to-begin","title":{"en":"0EWhere to Begin","zh":"0E从哪里开始"}}]}}]
